status GREEN -- amphora_framed_name plus all 16 elder lap-clock amphora guards, amphora_roster, tame_style_check, width-check. Hot scoped CLOSED over the tree that ships: 203 green, 5 red, tree_moved=no. Not one red is mine, each traced rather than assumed -- empty_document names a peer's zero-byte log 20260910-054448; crushed_index names eight lesson pages of 20260910.060225 with no wiki row; seed_link's ratchet rose on rule pages I never opened; tame_reach reads 553 of 552 with my whole round STASHED AWAY, so it predates the lap; and unheard_guard's pinned 460 became 461 when tools/rye/wrap_ring.rye landed in 44526f250, two commits before I opened. Cold open partial: 33 guards, 31 green, stopped by the bounded call before the first edit, six peer trees refused by name.
recommend keep-going -- restore_write_prove still writes each resin body before re-hashing it, and its cure is the same shape as this one: draw the boundary before the mutation, with a scratch name and a rename after the proof
